      "id": "dispatchdesk-response-loss",
      "title": "A lost response must not dispatch twice",
      "description": "The fulfillment commits, then the response is lost. Redelivery and a new transport message for the same business order must reuse the receipt.",
      "effectModel": "atomic-receipt",
      "observation": "complete",
      "expectedOrders": [
